<title>USA: F.Y.I. Inc Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>F.Y.I. Inc Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands, except for per share data)</p>
<p>						Quarter Ended</p>
<p>						  March 31,</p>
<p>				     1997	   1996</p>
<p>    Total revenues	   $32,124	$16,137		99%</p>
<p>    Gross profit		10,850	  5,323	     104%</p>
<p>    Operating income	   3,528	  1,491	     137%</p>
<p>    Net income		  $2,101	   $991	     112%</p>
<p>    Earnings per share	 $0.21	  $0.15		40%</p>
<p>Weighted average shares</p>
<p>     outstanding		 9,822	  6,480		52%</p>
